  "schema:name": "Elastic API JSON-LD context",
  "schema:description": "A JSON-LD @context for the objects Elastic's own API contract declares: one class per component schema, one property per declared field, typed from the contract. Derived by script (derive-json-ld.py, 2026-10-03) from openapi/elastic-account-api-openapi.yml, openapi/elastic-cluster-api-openapi.yml, openapi/elastic-data-views-api-openapi.yml.",
